  "method": "PowerPoint 16.115 for macOS exported two independent 1920x1080 30 fps videos of the same 12 changes, including a repeated horizontal checker. On each transition sample 15 internal times and 72 locations. Separate the outgoing and incoming color amounts on plain slides. On patterned slides compare three channels against the video, including four neutral markers at different positions on the two slides. All 11 distinct variants are checked separately.",
